WEB SOURCE (the specification) — web/src/components/ui/Input.tsx
  A PURE presentational form control (fetches nothing). Composition:
    div.space-y-1
      └─ if label:  div.flex.items-center.gap-1 [ <Label htmlFor required> + optional <HelpIcon for=help.for??inputId> ]
      └─ div.relative [ optional leading {icon} (abs left, text-muted)
                        <input ...sizeClasses[size]; border glass-border; bg surface-1; text-primary;
                               focus:ring-2 ring-blue-500; error⇒border-red-500; disabled:opacity-50;
                               pl-10 when icon; pr-10 when suffix>
                        optional trailing {suffix} (abs right) ]
      └─ error ? <p id={inputId}-error text-red-500>     : (hint && !error) ? <p id={inputId}-hint text-muted>
  Logic branches reproduced 1:1:
    • inputId = id || label?.toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,'-')
    • aria-describedby = error ? `${inputId}-error` : hint ? `${inputId}-hint` : undefined
    • aria-invalid = error ? 'true' : undefined ;  aria-required = required ? 'true' : undefined
    • <HelpIcon>: text = i18nKey ? t(i18nKey,{defaultValue:content??''}) : content??'' ; if(!text) return null ;
      aria-label = forId ? t('a11y.helpFor',{field}) : t('help.tooltip.iconLabel') ; describedby = `${forId}-help`
    • <Label required>: visible `*` (aria-hidden) + VisuallyHidden t('form.required')
    • sizeClasses: sm `px-2 py-1.5 text-xs` · md `px-3 py-2 text-sm` · lg `px-4 py-2.5 text-base` · auto density
  Prompt records Data sources / Shared components / Charts / i18n keys = (none) — anonymous presentational leaf.
  No loading/empty/error/stale/offline DATA lifecycle exists in the source (those belong to the embedding
  screen); the CONTROL states that DO exist — default·focused·invalid·hinted·disabled·leading-icon·
  trailing-suffix·required·secure·sm/md/lg/auto — are every one reproduced.

